WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.148
MUSIC AND MOVIES WERE MADE
FOR EACH OTHER.

00:00:04.148 --> 00:00:07.130
DECADES BEFORE TALKIES,
MOVIES HAD MUSIC.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.260
THEY NEEDED MUSIC, AND MUSIC
NEEDED THEM RIGHT BACK.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.500
THESE ARE THE NOMINEES
FOR BEST SCORE.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.890
"DA 5 BLOODS" BY
TERENCE BLANCHARD.

00:00:17.888 --> 00:00:21.131
"MANK" BY TRENT REZNOR
AND ATTICUS ROSS.

00:00:22.395 --> 00:00:26.040
"MINARI" BY
EMILE MOSSERI.

00:00:27.197 --> 00:00:30.820
"NEWS OF THE WORLD" BY
JAMES NEWTON HOWARD.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:36.257
"SOUL" BY TRENT REZNOR,
ATTICUS ROSS, AND JON BATISTE.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.960
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.743
TRENT REZNOR, ATTICUS ROSS,
AND JON BATISTE FOR "SOUL."

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:50.000
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:01:37.323 --> 00:01:40.588
HELLO. HELLO.

00:01:41.657 --> 00:01:46.590
MAN, YOU KNOW WHAT’S
DEEP IS THAT GOD GAVE

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:54.820
US 12 NOTES. IT’S THE SAME 12
NOTES DUKE ELLINGTON HAD,

00:01:54.820 --> 00:02:00.369
BACH HAD. IT’S THE SAME 12.
NINA SIMONE.

00:02:00.369 --> 00:02:02.729
AND ALL THE NOMINEES,
I JUST WANT TO FIRST POINT OUT

00:02:02.729 --> 00:02:08.170
THAT EVERY GIFT IS SPECIAL.
EVERY CONTRIBUTION WITH MUSIC

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:12.620
THAT COMES FROM THE DIVINE,
INTO THE INSTRUMENTS,

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:17.610
INTO THE FILM, INTO THE MINDS
AND HEARTS AND SOULS OF

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.620
EVERY PERSON WHO HEARS IT.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.140
THE STORIES THAT HAPPEN
WHEN YOU LISTEN TO IT

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.010
AND WATCH IT, AND THE
STORIES YOU SHARE, THE MOMENTS

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:28.160
YOU CREATE, THE MEMORIES
YOU MAKE.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:33.550
MAN, IT’S JUST SO INCREDIBLY
SPECIAL AND I JUST WANT TO FIRST

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:37.570
RECOGNIZE THE NOMINEES
AND SAY THAT I’M INCREDIBLY –

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:40.200
I’M SPEAKING FOR ALL OF US –
WE ARE INCREDIBLY HUMBLED

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:44.490
AND GRATEFUL TO THE ACADEMY
FOR THIS RECOGNITION, AND I’M

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:50.900
JUST THANKFUL TO GOD FOR
THOSE 12 NOTES. MAN, THAT’S SO DOPE.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:55.850
THANK YOU TO MY PARENTS, SULEIKA
FOR YOUR SUPPORT AND LOVE,

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.760
COMING HERE WITH ME, YOU FLEW
ON A PLANE FIRST TIME IN A YEAR.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.900
MY PARENTS TOOK ME AROUND 
CLUBS IN NEW ORLEANS

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.360
WHEN I WAS TEN YEARS OLD.
PUT ME IN PIANO LESSONS.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:12.450
MISS SHIRLEY, WILLIAM. JUST SO MUCH,
SO MUCH HAS HAPPENED.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:15.310
THIS MOMENT IS A CULMINATION
OF A SERIES OF MIRACLES.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.740
AND I JUST CAN’T EVEN GO
INTO ALL OF THEM.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:21.090
WE DON’T HAVE THAT MUCH TIME,
BUT IT'S JUST SO INCREDIBLY POWERFUL

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.940
TO BE STANDING HERE IN THE
LINEAGE THAT WE COME FROM

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.920
AND THE LINEAGE IN THIS FILM,
THE COLLABORATORS ON THIS FILM

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:28.870
ARE THE BEST THAT YOU COULD
HAVE EVER ASKED FOR

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.950
THE MOST GENEROUS, RIGOROUSLY
VISIONARY, COLLABORATIVE.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:36.880
PETE DOCTER IS A – I LOVE THIS MAN –
PETE DOCTER, HE’S A GENIUS

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:41.550
AND A VISIONARY. DANA MURRAY,
KEMP POWERS, TOM MCDOUGALL AT DISNEY.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.470
THANK YOU FOR WELCOMING US
TO THE FAMILY WITH OPEN ARMS.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:50.571
SO MUCH OF A TRUE COLLABORATIVE
PROCESS. MY TEAM. THANK Y’ALL FOR

00:03:50.571 --> 00:03:53.250
JUST DEALING WITH ME ’CAUSE MY,
I GET IDEAS ALL THE TIME,

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.670
CHANGING DIRECTION.
Y’ALL HOLDING ME DOWN.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:59.500
MICHAEL, CHRIS, ADAM, ALL THE
PEOPLE. AND THANK YOU ALL SO

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.080
MUCH FOR DOING WHAT YOU ALL
DO AND PUTTING IT ON THE LINE.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.400
PUTTING YOURSELF OUT THERE. IT’S
HARD TO PUT YOURSELF OUT THERE.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.530
THANK YOU ALL FOR PUTTING
YOURSELF OUT THERE.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:11.319
I’M A FAN OF LIKE EVERYBODY HERE.
SO, MUCH LOVE, MUCH LIKE TO YOU.

00:04:11.319 --> 00:04:13.230
I LOVE YOU EVEN IF
I DON’T KNOW YOU.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:13.970
LATER ON.

